    "explanation": "Mahadev Govind Ranade founded the Poona Sarvajanik Sabha in 1870, one of the earliest political associations in India.\n\n💡 Ranade basically opened the first 'citizens' forum' in Poona long before Congress existed -- a founding-father fact worth pinning on his name specifically.\n\n⚠️ Gokhale and Tilak are more famous Maharashtrian leaders, so people guess them instead of their mentor/senior Ranade.",
