    "question": "The Silent Valley which is home to rare plants and animals is located in which of the following State?",
    "options": [
      "Meghalaya",
      "Jammu and Kashmir",
      "Kerala",
      "Gujarat"
    ],
    "explanation": "The Silent Valley National Park, known for its rare flora and fauna, is located in Kerala.\n\n💡 Silent Valley is Kerala's 'quiet rainforest room' in the Western Ghats, kept undisturbed enough that rare species still thrive there.",
