    "question": "What should come in place of ‘a’ in the equation 38a4 + 98 = 3942?",
    "options": [
      "2",
      "4",
      "6",
      "8"
    ],
    "explanation": "Subtract 98 from 3942 to get 3844, which must equal \"38a4\" digit-by-digit, so the missing digit a = 4.\n\n💡 It's like a hidden digit in a phone number — do the subtraction, see 3844, and just read off the missing hole.\n\n⚠️ Picking \"8\" is tempting since 8 already appears elsewhere in \"38a4\", but you must match the computed number 3844, not repeat a digit.",
    "source": "MPSC State Tax Officer / Group B Gazetted",
    "year": 2025,
    "paperId": "mpsc-inspector-of-excise-&-narcotics-2025-gs-iii",
    "answerIndex": 1,
