    "explanation": "The differences double each time: 22 minus 16 = 6, 34 minus 22 = 12, 58 minus 34 = 24, 106 minus 58 = 48, so the next difference is 96 and the missing term is 106 plus 96 = 202. The rule is confirmed by the final term, since 202 plus 192 = 394. Equivalently each term is the previous term doubled minus 10, which also gives 2 times 106 minus 10 = 202.",
