    "difficulty": "medium",
    "question": "Consider the following statements (i) India launched its first full-fledged Meteorological Satellite (METSAT) in September, 2002. (ii) For the first time, the space vehicle PSLV C-4 carried a payload of more than 1000 kg into a gyosynchronous orbit Which of the statement (s) given above is/ are correct?",
