    "question": "Consider the following statements (i) Smart card is a plastic card with an embedded microchip (ii) Digital technology is primarily used with new physical communication medium such as satellite and fibre optics transmission (iii) A digital library is a collection of documents in an organized electronic form available on the internet only Which of the statement (s) given above is/ are correct?",
